    <div class="index-second">
      <h1>Welcome to Comrade David Ofoeyeno Special School</h1>
      <p>Welcome to Comrade David Ofoeyeno Special School, where every child's journey is met with compassion, dedication, and a commitment to excellence. Nestled in the heart of Udu, Delta State, our school stands as a beacon of hope and opportunity for children with neurological disorders and their families.</p>
      <p>Founded on the principles of inclusivity and empowerment, Comrade David Ofoeyeno Special School is more than just an educational institution — it's a community dedicated to unlocking the full potential of every child, regardless of their challenges. Named in honor of Comrade David Ofoeyeno, a visionary leader and advocate for children with special needs, our school embodies his spirit of resilience, compassion, and unwavering belief in the power of education to transform lives.</p>
      <p>At Comrade David Ofoeyeno Special School, our mission is simple yet profound: to provide a nurturing and inclusive environment where each student can thrive academically, socially, and emotionally. We are committed to fostering a culture of acceptance, understanding, and respect, where differences are celebrated and every child is valued for who they are.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="index-neuro">
      <div class="index-g">
        <h2>Our Vision</h2>
        <p>At our school, we believe in a holistic approach to education that recognizes the unique strengths, abilities, and challenges of each student. Through individualized learning plans, evidence-based practices, and a focus on meaningful outcomes, we empower students to reach their full potential and become active participants in their own learning journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="index-g">
        <img class="index-neuropix1" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/<%= bucketName %>/direct/s9.jpg" alt="School Activity" />
      </div>
    </div>

